  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the shadow of Guvnas Gate, 'Socket' lived a hardscrabble life.  His early days were spent scavenging for scraps, until a run in with a rival gang left him half-blind and fueled by vengeance. Now, he stalks the city, a one-eyed harbinger of payback, clad in blood-stained kicks and ready to settle the score.",
