    "name": "Socket",
    "personality": "Grim and Driven: Socket rarely speaks, his single Souler eye burning with intense focus. Resourceful and Cunning: Years of surviving in the ruins have taught him how to make the most of any situation. Loyal and Vengeful: fiercely protects those he considers his flock, and never forgets a slight.",
